@startuml
title Ciclo de vida de SimulationSession

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Empty

state Empty : sem configuração
state Configured : configuração validada pendente
state Prepared : simulador GPU criado e parado
state Running : simulador GPU executando
state Paused : simulador preservado e parado

Empty --> Configured : ApplyConfig(config)
Configured --> Running : Play() / cria FluidSimulator
Configured --> Prepared : Reset() / cria FluidSimulator

Prepared --> Running : Play()
Running --> Paused : Pause()
Paused --> Running : Play()
Running --> Prepared : Reset() / recria
Paused --> Prepared : Reset() / recria

Running --> Running : Update(delta_ms)\nproduz FluidRenderSnapshot
Paused --> Paused : Update()\nretorna último snapshot
Prepared --> Prepared : Update()\nretorna snapshot inicial

Running --> Configured : ApplyConfig(config)\ndescarta recursos anteriores
Paused --> Configured : ApplyConfig(config)\ndescarta recursos anteriores
Prepared --> Configured : ApplyConfig(config)\ndescarta recursos anteriores
Configured --> Configured : ApplyConfig(config)

Empty --> Empty : Clear()
Configured --> Empty : Clear()
Prepared --> Empty : Clear()
Running --> Empty : Clear()
Paused --> Empty : Clear()

Empty --> [*]

note right of Configured
  FluidSimulator é privado ao módulo.
  O renderer observa somente snapshots.
end note

@enduml
